ALGORITHM 1: LNS HEURISTIC.

1 Function LNS(s ∈ {solutions}, q ∈ N)
2 solution s_best = s;
3 repeat
4 s' = s;
5 remove q requests from s'
6 reinsert removed requests into s';
7 if (f(s') < f(s_best)) then
8 s_best = s';
9 if accept(s', s) then
10 s = s';
11 until stop-criterion met
12 return s_best;

